# Palmeiras Player Photos Extraction

**Session:** 2026-07-29 | **Status:** Completed successfully

---

## Overview

Successfully extracted all 26 Palmeiras first-team player profile screenshots and direct CDN image URLs from the official website (www.palmeiras.com.br/elenco/).

---

## Method

Used **Camofox** (Camoufox-based browser automation) via REST API:
- Navigated to squad page `/elenco/`
- Extracted all player profile links (`/jogador/?jogador={id}`)
- Created individual tabs for each player with session persistence
- Captured full-page screenshots (~1.6MB each)
- Also extracted direct CDN image URLs via JavaScript evaluation

